  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Finance and Community Improvement Programme (RFCIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le programme de financement rural et d&apos;am&#xe9;liorations communautaires (RFCIP) est con&#xe7;u pendant la phase de reconstruction suite &#xe0; la guerre civile de 11 ans qui s&apos;est achev&#xe9; en 2002. Il vise &#xe0; renforcer les capacit&#xe9;s du secteur de la finance rurale aux niveaux micro, m&#xe9;so et macro. Le programme devrait former des institutions collectives semi-formelles telles que des associations de services financiers (FSA) et des institutions formelles telles que des banques communautaires. Il devrait &#xe9;galement &#x153;uvrer &#xe0; la mise en place d&apos;institutions fa&#xee;ti&#xe8;res telles que l&apos;Agence d&apos;assistance technique (TAA). Le RFCIP comprend trois composantes, &#xe0; savoir: (1) l&apos;acc&#xe8;s aux services financiers ruraux; (2) l&apos;appui au d&#xe9;veloppement communautaire; et (3) la gestion du programme.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Rural Finance and Community Improvement Programme (RFCIP) is designed during the reconstruction phase following the 11-year civil conflict which ended in 2002. It aims to build the capacity of the rural finance sector at the micro, meso and macro levels. The programme should form collective semi-formal institutions such as Financial Services Associations (FSAs) and formal institutions such as community banks. It should also work on building apex institutions such as Technical Assistance Agency (TAA). The RFCIP consists of three components, namely: (1) access to Rural Financial Services; (2) support to Community Development; and (3) programme management.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">L&#x2019;objectif g&#xe9;n&#xe9;ral du programme est de r&#xe9;duire durablement la pauvret&#xe9; rurale et l&#x2019;ins&#xe9;curit&#xe9; alimentaire des m&#xe9;nages.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the programme is to reduce rural poverty and household food insecurity on a sustainable basis.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le programme vise &#xe0; servir les populations rurales pauvres &#xe9;conomiquement actifs, en particulier les femmes et les jeunes. Les principaux groupes cibles sont: (1) les m&#xe9;nages de petits exploitants agricoles, y compris les m&#xe9;nages dirig&#xe9;s par une femme; (2) les micro et petits entrepreneurs, y compris les femmes; et 3) les jeunes, y compris les ex-combattants et les jeunes femmes / m&#xe8;res c&#xe9;libataires victimes d&apos;abus sexuels.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims at serving the economically active rural poor, particularly women and the youth. The primary target groups are: (1) smallholder farming households, including female-headed households; (2) micro and small-scale entrepreneurs, including women; and (3) youth, including ex-combatants and sexually-abused young women/single mothers.</narrative>
  </description>
